---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Archive | Rooted Layers Mirror
description: Full mirrored archive of public Rooted Layers essays, filterable by title, tag, year, and series.
extraScripts:
  - /assets/archive.js
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="section__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Archive</p>
    <h1>Public essays mirrored with provenance intact</h1>
    <p class="lede">This archive is filtered from the public Substack feed and rendered from local markdown snapshots. Each page keeps its source links, research folder, and raw files attached.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="filters" data-archive-filters>
    <label>
      <span>Search</span>
      <input type="search" placeholder="Title or tag" data-filter-search>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>Year</span>
      <select data-filter-year>
        <option value="">All years</option>
        {% for year in archive.filters.years %}
        <option value="{{ year }}">{{ year }}</option>
        {% endfor %}
      </select>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>Series</span>
      <select data-filter-series>
        <option value="">All series</option>
        {% for series in archive.series %}
        <option value="{{ series.title | lower }}">{{ series.title }}</option>
        {% endfor %}
      </select>
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="card-grid" data-archive-results>
    {% for post in archive.posts %}
      {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="empty-state" data-archive-empty hidden>No posts match the current filter.</p>
</section>
